The batch Python implementation in fpga_lab/wifi_reference.py is newly written.
The external captures are downloaded unchanged using captures.json, which records
their upstream paths and SHA-256 digests. Existing OpenOFDM HDL is not included
in generation prompts. Each generated design records its source and prompt hashes.
